        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have assembled a team of software development experts in Israel needed for the development of the various levels of software required in the use of our APU products.",
        "start_character": 44859,
        "end_character": 45041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Because we have limited experience developing integrated circuit products other than Very Fast SRAMs, any efforts by us to introduce new products based on new technology, including our new in-place associative computing products, may not be successful and, as a result, our business may suffer.",
        "start_character": 48689,
        "end_character": 48983
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we fail to materially commercialize our APU products, we may not generate sufficient revenues to offset our development costs and other expenses, which will have an adverse impact on our business including a potential impairment of intangible assets and a negative impact on our market capitalization.",
        "start_character": 25804,
        "end_character": 26108
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "If we fail to obtain a license from a third party for technology used by us, we could incur substantial liabilities and be required to suspend the manufacture of products or the use by our foundry of certain processes.",
        "start_character": 52054,
        "end_character": 52272
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we provide our OEM customers with comprehensive datasheets, application notes and reference designs and access to our FPGA controller IP for use in their product development.",
        "start_character": 41344,
        "end_character": 41531
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we sell our products to OEM customers indirectly through domestic and international distributors.",
        "start_character": 34453,
        "end_character": 34563
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the event of an adverse result in any such litigation, we could be required to pay substantial damages, cease the manufacture, use and sale of infringing products, expend significant resources to develop non-infringing technology, discontinue the use of certain processes or obtain licenses to the infringing technology.",
        "start_character": 51636,
        "end_character": 51959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our marketing efforts are, first and foremost, focused on ensuring that the products we develop meet or exceed our customers’ needs.",
        "start_character": 39739,
        "end_character": 39871
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our master die methodology enables multiple product families, and variations thereof, to be manufactured from a single mask set so that we are able to maintain a common pool of wafers that incorporate all available master die, allowing rapid fulfillment of customer orders and reducing costs.",
        "start_character": 30380,
        "end_character": 30672
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop high-performance SRAM products that offer superior speed and low power consumption, utilizing advanced architectures, design methodologies and silicon process technologies that enable optimized yields, lower manufacturing costs and improve quality.",
        "start_character": 29666,
        "end_character": 29925
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We fund this development through our established legacy business designing and selling high-speed synchronous static random access memory (“SRAM”) products, primarily for the networking and telecommunications, test and measurement, and military/defense and aerospace markets.",
        "start_character": 427,
        "end_character": 702
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-070962",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-070962-070c8b4fc6be5eb3",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-070962",
        "filing_date": "2026-06-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have devoted substantial resources in the last ten years on the development of our APU products.",
